{% block body %}
<p>Mexico has two beach personalities. The <b>Caribbean</b> side, centred on Cancún and the Riviera Maya, is flat jungle meeting powder-white sand and turquoise water. The <b>Pacific</b> side, from Puerto Vallarta down to Oaxaca and across to Baja, is mountains dropping into a deep-blue ocean. Both are wonderful; they just suit different trips.</p>

